source: crates/yuanme-render/tests/org.rs
expression: "render(name, &text)"
---
<h2 id="example-of-org-babel-for-r-literate-programming">Example of Org-Babel for R Literate Programming</h2>
<h3 id="r-text-output">R text output</h3>
<p>A simple summary.</p>
<pre><code class="language-R">x &#x3C;- rnorm(10)
summary(x)
</code></pre>
<h3 id="r-graphics-output">R graphics output</h3>
<p>Note we use the object <code>x</code> generated in previous code block, thanks to
the header option <code>:session *R*</code>.  The output graphics file is
<code>a.png</code>.</p>
<pre><code class="language-R">y &#x3C;- rnorm(10)
plot(x, y)
</code></pre>
<p>Same plot with larger dimension:</p>
<pre><code class="language-R">plot(x, y)
</code></pre>
